Lab 4: Accessing VM Consoles
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the different methods for accessing virtual machine consoles in OpenShift Virtualization
Expose VM console access through the OpenShift web console interface
Configure and access VM consoles using VNC protocol
Establish remote desktop connections to virtual machines
Troubleshoot common console connectivity issues
Implement security best practices for VM console access
