Understanding console access methods is particularly important for:

System Administration: Performing maintenance tasks that require direct VM access
Troubleshooting: Diagnosing issues when network-based access is unavailable
User Support: Providing remote assistance to users working within virtual machines
Security Compliance: Implementing proper access controls and audit trails for VM console access
The knowledge gained in this lab prepares you for real-world scenarios where reliable and secure VM console access is critical for maintaining virtualized infrastructure in OpenShift environments.
